This file introduces configuration of upperstack image.

/*============================================================================*
 *                          upperstack_0_0                                    *
 *============================================================================*/
If Application uses upperstack_0_0, Application should configure UPPERSTACK_GLOBAL_SIZE
as value which is larger than or equal to (2 * 1024) in mem_config.h of Application.

/** @brief data ram size for upperstack global variables and code */
#define UPPERSTACK_GLOBAL_SIZE        (2*1024)

Bluetooth features supported by the upperstack_0_0 are introduced in the upperstack_config.h
file in the upperstack_0_0 folder. The path of upperstack_config.h for upperstack_0_0 is
sdk\bin\upperstack_img\upperstack_0_0\upperstack_config.h.

/*============================================================================*
 *                          upperstack_findmy_0                                    *
 *============================================================================*/
If Application uses upperstack_findmy_0, Application should configure UPPERSTACK_GLOBAL_SIZE
as value which is larger than or equal to (2 * 1024) in mem_config.h of Application.

/** @brief data ram size for upperstack global variables and code */
#define UPPERSTACK_GLOBAL_SIZE        (2*1024)

Bluetooth features supported by the upperstack_findmy_0 are introduced in the upperstack_config.h
file in the upperstack_findmy_0 folder. The path of upperstack_config.h for upperstack_findmy_0 is
sdk\bin\upperstack_img\upperstack_findmy_0\upperstack_config.h.